SUMMARY:Chortle Student Comedy Award Final
LOCATION:Pleasance Courtyard\, 60 Pleasance\, Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Come and witness the future of stand-up as one rising star will
  be crowned Britain's funniest student after a nationwide hunt by leading c
 omedy website Chortle. Previous finalists include Joe Lycett\, Phil Wang\, 
 Chris Ramsey\, Laura Lexx\, Jamali Maddix\, Simon Bird\, Glenn Moore\, Tom 
 Rosenthal\, Mat Ewins\, Richard Gadd\, Lauren Pattison\, Pierre Novellie\, 
 Tim Renkow\, Ania Magliano\, Joe Kent-Walters\, Bethany Black and many more
 . Who'll be next? Find out in this exciting Fringe highlight\, compered by 
 festival favourite Mark Watson.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-
 atlas/event/chortle-student-comedy-award-final-27444/
